<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>12 / 自进化与扩展</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>模型更新怎样验收，人工改进维护什么</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}><Box style={{ width: 560, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>模型更新验收</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>训练前明确改进目标：首错定位、少作无依据归因、步骤结构完整、更适当的提示。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>保留未参与训练和案例注入的独立测试数据，按学生、题目及变式来源控制泄漏。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>只提高格式遵守率，不能直接称为提高数学准确率；只提高答案正确率，也不能直接称为提高教学质量。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>候选版本先小范围使用，明显退化可回滚；不以同一模型给自己的高分作为发布依据。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 560, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>人工改进的五类维护对象</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>数据集：正确与错误作答、不同解法、证据不足、改正过程、生成题目、教师纠错。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>教学定义：知识点、步骤、套路、适用条件、易混淆项、前置关系。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>难度与评分：步骤默认难度、实例难度量规、试卷模板、覆盖权重。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>训练与推荐参数：复查间隔、任务量、推荐优先级、诊断门槛。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>提示词与工具规则：字段约束、判断要求、异常处理、工具适用范围。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E7BE0', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>每次修改记录原因、负责人、版本、受影响范围；训练集、调参集与独立测试集分开维护。不能因某次结果不符合预期就临时调参直到“看起来正确”</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：自进化与跨学科扩展设计.md §2.4、§3</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 118 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>